---
// StructuralDependencies.astro - Section about structural dependencies of today's internet
---

<section
  class="py-16 px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-8 flex flex-col justify-center items-center bg-dark1"
  id="structural-dependencies"
>
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] w-full">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="text-blue1 section-heading mb-20 lg:mb-28">
        Dependencies of the current ecosystem
      </h2>
      
      <div class="space-y-8 text-white">
        <div>
          <h3 class="custom-content-title mb-3">Continuity</h3>
          <p class="custom-content-text-gray">
            Your access and usage are tied to cloud providers. They can lock you out. 
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div>
          <h3 class="custom-content-title mb-3">Identity</h3>
          <p class="custom-content-text-gray">
            Your digital identity is tied to email, phone, or social logins. They can lock you out.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div>
          <h3 class="custom-content-title mb-3">Control</h3>
          <p class="custom-content-text-gray">
            Your data resides on their platform, subject to policy changes and legal requirements. You have limited control, and the rules can change at any time.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
